Z||000002||mshill||05-09-2000||01:44 AM||||Cooter, I've been watching the paper here (Sacramento, CA) and have been seeing the prices of Fieros steadily rise over the past six months.  For instance, in the August 99 timeframe when I was shopping for my first, I had 3-4 to choose from in the 700-1500 price range, and they were all V6s.  Now if there are any in the paper at all, they are asking 2500-3500 for them, and some are even 4 bangers.  The projects seem to be fewer and far between.<BR>||||reg||1
