Z||000008||batboy||05-09-2000||05:50 PM||||There were no overdrive auto trannies put into Fieros from the factory. Only one auto tranny was ever used in Fieros, the TH125 which is a 3 speed. It's actually a pretty good and reliable tranmission. A good driver with a 5-speed manual might get a couple extra mpg and maybe a couple extra mph more top end, but sure not enough to be concerned about. A fast manual shifter might be a tiny bit quicker in the quarter mile too, but an auto Fiero is still a blast to drive, I have two.||||reg||1
